# Mario Golf: Advance Tour (USA) -- Multiplayer > With Game Link (Multiple
# Game Paks).  KNOWN GAME-LEVEL FAILURE on the mirror: both machines stay on
# "Please connect the Game Boy Advance Game Link cable" forever.  The cable
# runs (multi-player transfers every scanline-ish), and both consoles agree
# frame for frame, but the child only ever echoes the parent's previous word
# and its own link task never starts (Mario Tennis, the same Camelot packet
# format, syncs by its third packet).  docs/GBA-LINK-MIRROR.md 16.4.
# The fixture stays in the matrix so a fix shows up as a change of verdict:
# GAME_FAIL makes the row FAIL whatever determinism says.
